version: 4
origin: studio
aoi:
  name: Latihan_5a_Hari_3
  description: "Sistem kontrol lampu berbasis komparasi akumulasi counter (LT Comparison): START_PUSH_BUTTON menambah nilai akumulasi COUNTER_1 (maksimum preset 10). Selama nilai akumulasi hitungan (COUNTER_1.ACC) kurang dari 5 (LT ACC, 5), START_LAMP tetap menyala. Ketika hitungan mencapai 5 atau lebih, START_LAMP padam. STOP_PUSH_BUTTON mereset counter ke 0 sehingga lampu menyala kembali."
  tags:
    input:
      - name: START_PUSH_BUTTON
        dataType: BOOL
      - name: STOP_PUSH_BUTTON
        dataType: BOOL
    output:
      - name: START_LAMP
        dataType: BOOL
    local:
      - name: COUNTER_1
        dataType: COUNTER
        defaultValue:
          PRE: 10
      - name: LIMIT_5
        dataType: DINT
        defaultValue: 5
  routines:
    Logic:
      type: ld
      content: |-
        XIC(START_PUSH_BUTTON)CTU(COUNTER_1,10,0);
        LT(COUNTER_1.ACC,LIMIT_5)OTE(START_LAMP);
        XIC(STOP_PUSH_BUTTON)RES(COUNTER_1);
